..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SERAUO.TBUFOLGE.BN
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Erstellt Lieferschein zu Serviceangebot/Serviceauftrag
.. Functionality  : Creates delivery slip to service offer / service order
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. only create delivery notes for service orders
.continue END     ?   M|tvorgang^typ <> 34
..
.. start delivery from service order: <sales>'id'<delivery>
.command -parallel 'F|formatstr("<(Sales)> {1} <(Delivery)>", M|tvorgang^id)'
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
